{
  "name": "HL · Newsletter team (4.7)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Newsletter team\nLesson 4.7. Every Monday 06:00: Researcher (small model, temperature 0, two read-only tools, structured output) → research checked in code → Writer → Editor (checklist, structured verdict), at most two revision rounds, unrolled as nodes → Gmail DRAFT to Tolu (never an automatic send).\n\n**Credentials:** OpenAI (3 model nodes), Telegram API (alert), Gmail OAuth2.\n**Replace:** YOUR_SMALL_MODEL; YOUR_STRONG_MODEL; YOUR_EDITOR_MODEL; YOUR_PRICE_HISTORY_WORKFLOW_ID; YOUR_TOP_SELLERS_WORKFLOW_ID; YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID; tolu@harvestlane.example (Tolu's address).\n\nWorkflow timeout is set to 10 minutes in Settings. Connect Settings → Error workflow to HL · Error alerts.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "7a5cfaea-d3e6-47a8-a54e-6f8cd36aad86",
